# Assets for the claude-builtins plugin. `prompts/` is reproduced byte-for-byte
# from the Claude Code binary so the rebuilt commands behave identically to the
# built-ins — reformatting changes prompt semantics (indentation carries list
# nesting and blockquote scope) and breaks the ascii-bar alignment.
# `insights-template.html` is plugin-authored rather than extracted, but is
# equally off-limits: it is a token-substitution template whose {{TOKEN}}
# placeholders and inline <style>/<script> blocks prettier would reflow.
